  "summary": "Tahnee Smith is a Lead Software Engineer at Magnopus with expertise in mobile app development. Previously, Tahnee worked at Technocel, HammerCat Studio, and High Impact Games, developing solutions that interface with hardware, optimize gameplay, and enhance user experience. At Magnopus, she leads innovative projects, leveraging her diverse technical skills to create cutting-edge applications across multiple platforms. Tahnee has worked on numerous acclaimed projects including Disney movies VR, Disney’s Coco VR, CNN VR, Expo Dubai Xplorer, and several other AR projects.\nAs a lead engineer, Tahnee spearheaded the development process for the recently launched Alo Moves XR project in close collaboration with Alo and Meta. Her role involved comprehensive roadmap planning, ensuring alignment with project milestones and strategic objectives. Through extensive technical explorations, Tahnee focused on creating immersive media experiences that resonate with Alo's brand identity and vision. This involved rigorous testing and iteration to deliver high-quality content that reflects the ethos of Alo while pushing the boundaries of XR technology.",
